# A call stays open while the person asks the agent about it: the question and the answer go in
# the chat, and the call's folded row stays at the end of the transcript until a choice is picked.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
replies call-follow-up.json
project storefront shop
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "question {\"questions\":[{\"question\":\"Which store should the product page cache use?\",\"header\":\"Cache store\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Redis (recommended)\",\"description\":\"Fast, shared by every app server, already running in staging\"},{\"label\":\"SQLite\",\"description\":\"No server to keep up, one file per app server\"}]}]}"
settle 6
say "Would SQLite hold up with three app servers reading the cache at once?"
settle 8
front Wren
settle 2
snap follow-up
